{"id":"mtk-05d-konversi-volume-campur","type":"subbab","subject":"mtk","chapter":"mtk-05","subBab":"mtk-05d","slug":"konversi-volume","tier":"campur","title":"OSN SD — Matematika Sub-Bab 05d","theory":[{"title":"A. Tangga Satuan Volume","content":"```\n          km³\n            \\  (× 1.000 turun)\n          hm³\n            \\\n          dam³\n            \\\n          m³\n            \\\n          dm³        ← 1 dm³ = 1 liter\n            \\\n          cm³        ← 1 cm³ = 1 mL\n            \\\n          mm³\n```\n\n**ATURAN EMAS:**\n- **Turun 1 tingkat: × 1.000**\n- **Naik 1 tingkat: ÷ 1.000**\n- (Bukan ×10 seperti panjang, bukan ×100 seperti luas!)"},{"title":"B. Konversi yang Sering Dipakai","content":"- 1 m³ = 1.000 dm³ = 1.000.000 cm³\n- 1 dm³ = 1.000 cm³\n- 1 cm³ = 1.000 mm³\n- 1 km³ = 1.000.000.000 m³ (1 miliar m³)"},{"title":"C. Volume ↔ Kapasitas (Liter)","content":"- **1 dm³ = 1 liter (L)**\n- **1 cm³ = 1 mL = 1 cc**\n- **1 m³ = 1.000 L = 1 kiloliter (kL)**\n- 1 L = 1.000 mL\n- 1 hL = 100 L (sering dipakai pertanian)"},{"title":"D. Tangga Liter (× 10 per tingkat)","content":"```\nkL — hL — daL — L — dL — cL — mL\n```\n- Turun 1 tingkat: × 10\n- Naik 1 tingkat: ÷ 10"},{"title":"E. Hubungan Penting","content":"- 1 m³ = 1 kL = 1.000 L\n- 1 dm³ = 1 L\n- 1 cm³ = 1 mL\n- 250 mL = 250 cm³ = 0,25 L = 0,25 dm³"},{"title":"F. Aplikasi","content":"- **Bak mandi**: biasanya dihitung dalam liter atau dm³.\n- **Tangki bensin**: liter.\n- **Botol minum**: mL atau L.\n- **Kolam renang**: m³ (sering dikonversi ke liter saat hitung biaya air)."},{"title":"G. Kesalahan Umum (Hindari!)","content":"1. Pakai ×10 untuk tangga volume (itu rumus panjang, bukan volume).\n2. Pakai ×100 untuk tangga volume (itu rumus luas).\n3. Salah arah: turun seharusnya ×1.000 malah ÷1.000.\n4. Lupa: 1 dm³ = 1 L (bukan 1 cm³ = 1 L).\n5. Hitung 1 m³ = 100 L (salah; benar 1.000 L).\n6. Salah loncat tingkat (m³ ke cm³ = 3 tingkat = ×1.000.000, bukan ×1.000).\n\n---"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"subTopic":"TINGKAT KABUPATEN (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"1 m³ sama dengan … dm³.","options":{"A":"1.000","B":"100","C":"10.000","D":"1.000.000"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":2,"subTopic":"TINGKAT KABUPATEN (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"5 dm³ sama dengan … cm³.","options":{"A":"50","B":"500","C":"5.000","D":"50.000"},"answerKey":"C","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":3,"subTopic":"TINGKAT KABUPATEN (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"1 dm³ sama dengan … liter.","options":{"A":"100","B":"10","C":"1.000","D":"1"},"answerKey":"D","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":4,"subTopic":"TINGKAT KABUPATEN (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"1 cm³ sama dengan … mL.","options":{"A":"1","B":"0,1","C":"0,001","D":"1.000"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":5,"subTopic":"TINGKAT KABUPATEN (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"2 m³ sama dengan … liter.","options":{"A":"200","B":"2.000","C":"20.000","D":"200.000"},"answerKey":"B","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":6,"subTopic":"TINGKAT KABUPATEN (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"3.000 cm³ sama dengan … dm³.","options":{"A":"300","B":"3","C":"30","D":"0,3"},"answerKey":"B","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":7,"subTopic":"TINGKAT KABUPATEN (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"1 m³ = … cm³.","options":{"A":"1.000","B":"10.000","C":"100.000","D":"1.000.000"},"answerKey":"D","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":8,"subTopic":"TINGKAT KABUPATEN (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Bak air berisi 500 dm³. Berapa liter isinya?","options":{"A":"500","B":"50","C":"5","D":"5.000"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"